	(text "Keys: active-high to 3V3, 100k pull-down each (all on RTC GPIOs, for ext1 deep-sleep\nwake with ANY_HIGH). GPIO 34/35/36 have no internal pulls, so the external ones are\nrequired there. 100 nF debounce caps are optional (DNP); the firmware debounces.\nKey footprints are placeholders until the enclosure is chosen (6 mm THT, tall plunger;\nSETUP short, recessed)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
